00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,800
Hi, I'm Can, a metallurgical and
materials engineer. This is IsoShift.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,809
Swap hydrogen for deuterium in a
hydrogen-bonded crystal and, in our

3
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:15,851
calculations, it leans toward the
polymorph with the shorter O-H bonds.

4
00:00:15,871 --> 00:00:21,249
Three machine-learned potentials get this
sign in 185 of 212 cases where the

5
00:00:21,269 --> 00:00:26,930
